# ==============================================================================
# SAMARPOT - PORTFOLIO ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
# ==============================================================================
# This file contains the API keys and configuration for the contact form:
# 1. Email delivery to Samar
# 2. WhatsApp notification delivery to Samar
# NOTE: .env.local is ignored in .gitignore and will never be committed to Git.
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. SAMAR'S CONTACT DESTINATIONS
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Samar's destination email address where contact messages will arrive:
SAMAR_RECEIVER_EMAIL=taibanisamar@gmail.com

# Samar's WhatsApp number with country code (e.g. 919876543210 for India):
SAMAR_WHATSAPP_NUMBER=919313936630

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. EMAIL SERVICE (RESEND - Free 3,000 emails/month)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Get your free key at: https://resend.com
RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_api_key_here

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. WHATSAPP NOTIFICATION SERVICE (OPTION A: CallMeBot - 100% Free WhatsApp API)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# CallMeBot sends direct WhatsApp messages to your personal phone for free without business approval.
# To get your free API key:
# 1. Add CallMeBot on WhatsApp: +34 644 44 20 89 (or check https://www.callmebot.com/blog/free-api-whatsapp-messages/)
# 2. Send message: "I allow callmebot to send me messages"
# 3. You will receive an API key instantly! Put it below:
CALLMEBOT_API_KEY=

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. WHATSAPP NOTIFICATION SERVICE (OPTION B: Twilio WhatsApp - Optional)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# If using Twilio WhatsApp sandbox/business:
TWILIO_ACCOUNT_SID=
TWILIO_AUTH_TOKEN=
TWILIO_WHATSAPP_FROM=+14155238886
